    Noto Sans Medium 2.001. Copyright 2019 Google Inc. Unmodified.
    SIL Open Font License 1.1; the notice travels with it as
    mmo/res/fonts/OFL.txt.
    Compiled into openmmo-view and into the handheld library rather
    than installed beside them, so the game's window has a face on
    every platform with nothing to put there. It is the family official
    draws its own in-game UI with; a player who points the window at
    an extracted client gets that client's CJK cut of it instead.

